  "contract": [
    "Independent catalog HTTP/CLI transport, timer and generation; no inference state reuse",
    "Explicit refresh/cancel/retry; automatic events deduplicated without failure retry loops",
    "Typed IDs, source provenance, capabilities and manual/empty model choice preserved",
    "Effective runtime/connection/environment identity and editor-local shared login generation reject stale responses",
    "Native process-group protocol retains the leader through terminal JSON and tears down owned CLI descendants",
    "Stable detached snapshot consumed by Tianshu; widget traversal and unused per-session catalog copies removed"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic CLI/HTTP fixtures are not proof of real provider account availability or all-provider inference",
    "Windows process/job boundary requires its platform CI; POSIX process-boundary fixture is measured locally",
    "External CLI credential-file/account changes are not automatically detected; no raw CLI credential files were read",
    "Issue971 session/node model persistence remains owned by its original operator; remote delivery belongs to root",
    "Full legacy ai_chat_integration matrix was not rerun; targeted native catalog, HTTP, model picker, project configuration and Tianshu regressions passed"
  ],
